    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 9 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Seers of Sea and Sky<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Harvest</p><p>A tall lighthouse whose rotating lenses make its light visible from far away, even in poor weather. The hireling runs the machinery and lights or douses the lamp as you direct.</p><p><strong>Vision Charm.</strong> After a Long Rest in your Lighthouse, you gain the Charm of Darkvision.</p><p><strong>Harvest: Illuminate Treasure.</strong> The hireling watches the surrounding area for lost or discarded valuables for 7 days. You can then hire salvagers for 100 GP, who return with treasure worth 1d4 × 100 GP.</p><p><em>Source: Arcana Unleashed.</em></p>",
